{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Reaching an Agreement", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Reviewing the Details", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about common technology in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Present Perfect ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " The Present Perfect is a combination of the present tense and the perfect aspect.  ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The <span class=\"italic\">tense</span> demonstrates the position of an event or action <span class=\"strong\">in time</span>. In the Present Perfect, you use a present tense (has/have) because the action happened close to the present and has connection to the present. <br> The <span class=\"italic\">aspect</span> refers to how you should view the event in relation to time (in other words the <span class=\"strong\">perspective</span>). In the Present Perfect, you use a Perfect aspect - the end of the action is known and is used to emphasize the fact that the action is complete.<br> The Present Perfect is used to express a past event that has present consequences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> to:  <ol type=\"a\"><li>Talk about finished actions with a result in the present.<br/>\t<span class=\"italic\">He'<span class=\"underline\">s canceled </span>his appearance.</span> (He's not coming.)<br/> \t<span class=\"italic\">We'<span class=\"underline\">ve gotten</span> everything ready for the event.</span> (You can see now that it's all done.) <br/><br/>\t <li>Talk about an action when the time is not important.<br/> \t<span class=\"italic\">I'<span class=\"underline\">ve had</span> to deal with him before.<br/> \tHe'<span class=\"underline\">s suggested</span> that he was available.</span></li>  <Br/><li>Talk about a single or repeated action in the past. <br/>\t<span class=\"italic\">He'<span class=\"underline\">s struggled</span> with his health before. </li></ol>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Asking for Clarification", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Sometimes you don't understand what was said or something was not clear to you. It is, therefore, important to express your lack of understanding and seek clarification from the person you are talking to. Here are some ways you can ask for clarification. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ol type = \"a\"><li>Use a tag question.<br/>   <span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"underline\"> You're</span> feeling good about this plan,  <span class=\"underline\"> aren't you</span>?</span></li><br/>  <li>Use the phrases \"do you mean ... \", \"are you saying \u2026 \", \"does that mean ... \" or  \"or did you ... \" and the information you need clarification on. <br/> <span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"underline\">Do you mean</span> he's not going to be our master of  ceremonies?<br/>  <span class=\"underline\">Does that mean</span> we'll need to find someone else?<br/>  <span class=\"underline\">You mean</span> he can't be our MC?</span></li> <br/> <li>Use the informal phrase \"You mean ... \"<br/>   <span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"underline\">You mean</span> he canceled his participation in the event?</span></li></ol>", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to get everything in place", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to get everything arranged and organized", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think we've gotten everything in place.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear when an event is being planned. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to have charisma", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a strong, likeable personal quality that attracts people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They have charisma and are great with an audience. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "touch base with", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to communicate with someone you haven't contacted for a while and see how they are doing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll touch base with him. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "dealings", "type": "name"}, {"content": "business activities or other general relations you have with another person or organization", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've had a few dealings with him in the past.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "MC", "type": "name"}, {"content": "short for Master of Ceremonies; the host of a staged event", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun; abbreviated form)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our MC has cancelled at the last minute.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "backup plan", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a plan ready to be followed if the first plan fails ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We need a backup plan.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "first-rate job", "type": "name"}, {"content": "work of the highest quality", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I know he'd do a first-rate job.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to struggle", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to try hard to do something difficult", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He's struggled with his health before. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "You and your partner are <br>going to role play a situation.<br> One will be student A <br>The other will be student B.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Student A</span><br/> You are organizing an office party. Look at the list. Tell your party assistant what has been confirmed. Ask for clarification on the others.<br/>Time: 6 p.m. (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">confirmed</span>)<br/> MC: Mark Ronson (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">confirmed</span>)<br/> Location: Cafeteria (2nd floor) or Party Room (3rd floor)(<span class=\\\"italic\\\">clarify</span>)<br/> Music: DJ or Mariachi band (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">clarify</span>)<br/>  Food: Japanese or Chinese (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">clarify</span>)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Student B</span><br/> Your friend is organizing an office party. Assist him/her. He/She will ask for confirmation on the following.<br/>   Location: Party Room (3rd floor)<br/>  Music: DJ<br/>  Food: Chinese\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Read your cards and prepare for the activity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Start the role play.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I organize an office party.", "type": "text"}, {"c