e planned to contact him or should I?", "time": "25000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn7le14ob07re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Leave it to me. I'll touch base with him. I've had a few dealings with him in the past. Or did you want the opportunity to meet him?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, I'll get a good view of him at the event. I know he'd do a first-rate job at the party if he agrees, but I think I'd enjoy him better at a distance.", "time": "55000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "\"We need to contact another MC. Ours has canceled last minute. I know it's just before the party but he's struggled with his health before. We will need to come up with a backup plan. I can touch base with a friend who is great. He has charisma and I'm sure he'll do a first-rate job. \""}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}